cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
relation.1	1	converter	convert					the input values are written as one relation, the sheet of the input values
relation.2	1	converter	convert					an instance a $ref applies to a child location is written to its kind's one sheet
relation.3	1	converter	convert					a $ref that allOf applies adds to its instance's own schema, not as a kind
relation.4	1	converter	convert					the types a location allows are narrowed by every subschema allOf applies there
relation.5	1	converter	convert					each value is written in one of three places: a column, a sheet of its own, or the sheet of instances
relation.6	1	converter	convert					a required property of exactly one simple type is a column of its sheet
relation.7	1	converter	convert					a subordinate sheet whose child instances allow exactly one simple type has one column, _value
relation.8	1	converter	convert					a required property of exactly one type, object, is written as members of the instance that holds it
relation.9	1	converter	convert					a property of exactly one type, array, is struck from its parent and written as a subordinate sheet
relation.10	1	converter	convert					a property of exactly one type, object, not required, is a subordinate sheet of one record or none
relation.11	1	converter	convert					a subschema anyOf applies to the same location, of exactly one type, object, is a subordinate sheet of that location's sheet
relation.12	1	converter	convert					a child location of other than one type whose anyOf gives its branches is placed branch by branch
relation.13	1	converter	convert					an element that is itself an array is a subordinate sheet of its own
relation.14	1	converter	convert					a string that holds a line break is written as its runs of text to the sheet of runs
relation.15	1	converter	convert					where the root schema allows other than exactly one type, the sheet of the input values is the sheet of instances
relation.16	1	converter	convert					each value is written once: a member its properties names by its own schema, any other by additionalProperties
relation.17	1	converter	convert					no column is given from an allOf subschema for a property the location's own schema names
relation.19	1	converter	convert					no sheet is shaped from not, propertyNames, definitions or contains
relation.18	1	converter	convert					each relation is given with the parts of its path, each column with the parts of its label
